## Continuous SDK/Titan cutover, 2026-09-14

The settled segment-11 handoff DB SHA-256 was `cabe5372bd11729bd33468c311e9e980e5e20ddfa9bd47c973943be473cecd02`, 538,599,424 bytes, integrity `ok`. It retained all historical succeeded, uncertain and reserved ledger states. The canonical empty blocklist SHA-256 was `e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855`. Full manifest: `slop/deployment/2026-09-14_continuous-rust-manifest.txt`.

Revision `e1c8fbe` proved relay collection but every Titan request failed at HTTP dispatch. The writer was stopped after 64 new uncertain rows. Exact-image unpaid diagnostics then observed:

